sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant A as Client A
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database
    participant B as Client B

    A->>BE: POST /auth/login
    BE->>DB: Kiểm tra user
    DB-->>BE: OK
    BE-->>A: user + JWT

    A->>BE: Socket connect (auth.token)
    BE->>BE: Verify JWT + rate limit

    alt Token không hợp lệ
        BE-->>A: connect_error
    else Hợp lệ
        BE-->>A: connection OK
        BE->>BE: join user:A + đánh dấu online
        BE-->>A: presence (snapshot)
        BE-->>B: presence online (A)
    end
